      "worked": "<strong>Example</strong> — four processes, all arriving at time 0, in the order P1, P2, P3, P4.<br><br><strong>Process&nbsp;&nbsp;Burst Time</strong><br>P1&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;5 ms<br>P2&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3 ms<br>P3&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;8 ms<br>P4&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;4 ms<br><br><strong>Step 1 — Gantt chart</strong> (serve in arrival order):<br><code>| P1 | P2 | P3 | P4 |</code><br><code>0....5....8...16...20</code><br><br><strong>Step 2 — Completion time</strong> = where each block ends:<br>P1 = 5, P2 = 8, P3 = 16, P4 = 20<br><br><strong>Step 3 — Turnaround = Completion − Arrival</strong> (arrival is 0 for all):<br>P1 = 5, P2 = 8, P3 = 16, P4 = 20<br><br><strong>Step 4 — Waiting = Turnaround − Burst</strong>:<br>P1 = 5 − 5 = <strong>0</strong><br>P2 = 8 − 3 = <strong>5</strong><br>P3 = 16 − 8 = <strong>8</strong><br>P4 = 20 − 4 = <strong>16</strong><br><br><strong>Step 5 — Averages</strong>:<br>Average Waiting Time = (0 + 5 + 8 + 16) / 4 = 29 / 4 = <strong>7.25 ms</strong><br>Average Turnaround Time = (5 + 8 + 16 + 20) / 4 = 49 / 4 = <strong>12.25 ms</strong><br><br><em>Self-check:</em> average burst = (5+3+8+4)/4 = 5. And 7.25 + 5 = 12.25 ✓",
