        "Uses a whole quantum → <strong>demoted</strong> (it looks CPU-bound). Blocks for I/O early → stays high (it looks interactive).",
        "Higher-priority queues get <strong>smaller quanta</strong>; lower queues get larger quanta and usually run FCFS.",
